        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fresh twist on the classic block puzzle formula.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpinGrid challenges your reflexes and strategy in a rotating arena where the rules are simple but the gameplay is endlessly engaging. Instead of clearing lines, you’ll need to create solid 3x3 block formations — all while the playfield spins and an indestructible core stone sits at the center of every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts. Every rotation changes your perspective. Can you adapt and outlast the spin?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Rotating Arena – After every round, the grid spins, forcing you to think ahead and adapt your strategy on the fly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 Core Stone Mechanic – The unbreakable stone at the center changes how you place your pieces, making every match feel unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 3x3 Challenge – Forget line clears; the goal is to form 3x3 blocks for points. Simple to learn, tricky to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed – No pressure, no speed increase. Perfect for practicing or unwinding.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard – Classic puzzle action with gradually increasing drop speeds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore – Faster, tougher, with falling stone blocks that can only be destroyed through clever play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Global Leaderboards – Compete against players worldwide in all three modes and prove your block mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play SpinGrid?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re looking for a relaxing puzzle session, a test of quick thinking, or a competitive score chase, SpinGrid offers something for everyone. With its simple controls, rotating twist on classic block puzzlers, and addictive gameplay loop, it’s a game you’ll keep coming back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to spin, place, and outsmart the grid.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fresh twist on the classic block puzzle formula.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpinGrid challenges your reflexes and strategy in a rotating arena where the rules are simple but the gameplay is endlessly engaging. Instead of clearing lines, you’ll need to create solid 3x3 block formations — all while the playfield spins and an indestructible core stone sits at the center of every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts. Every rotation changes your perspective. Can you adapt and outlast the spin?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Rotating Arena – After every round, the grid spins, forcing you to think ahead and adapt your strategy on the fly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 Core Stone Mechanic – The unbreakable stone at the center changes how you place your pieces, making every match feel unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 3x3 Challenge – Forget line clears; the goal is to form 3x3 blocks for points. Simple to learn, tricky to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed – No pressure, no speed increase. Perfect for practicing or unwinding.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard – Classic puzzle action with gradually increasing drop speeds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore – Faster, tougher, with falling stone blocks that can only be destroyed through clever play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Global Leaderboards – Compete against players worldwide in all three modes and prove your block mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play SpinGrid?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re looking for a relaxing puzzle session, a test of quick thinking, or a competitive score chase, SpinGrid offers something for everyone. With its simple controls, rotating twist on classic block puzzlers, and addictive gameplay loop, it’s a game you’ll keep coming back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to spin, place, and outsmart the grid.</p>",
